  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accelerate mangrove restoration through beneficial reuse of dredged material</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consortium partners Deltares, Boskalis, InterConnect, Conservation International Suriname and the Anton de Kom University of Suriname will study the feasibility of using sediments dredged from the Suriname river to accelerate mangrove restoration. Using sediments for intertidal area restoration is unique and promises to be an effective solution. In addition, lessons learned will be valuable for replicating and mainstreaming this restoration method in other regions.</narrative>
  </description>
